## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Required behavior matches the OpenSpec scenarios.
- [ ] Tests or documented manual checks cover the changed behavior.
- [ ] No required capability remains unimplemented without a blocker.
- [ ] Project Refresh Impact is recorded and its release gate passes when this
  change affects DevFlow.
- [ ] No provider was inferred, discovered, installed, activated, invoked, or
  silently substituted by the implementation-readiness gate.

## Validation Commands

```bash
<focused test command>
<broader verification command>
```

## Final Verification

- [ ] Focused tests pass.
- [ ] Broader tests, lint, typecheck, or build pass where applicable.
- [ ] Verification evidence is recorded.
- [ ] Project Refresh Impact, migration fixtures, and source/release/cache
  parity are verified or explicitly not applicable.
- [ ] Applicable Requirement/Evidence/Receipt bindings are current, or the exact
  Required/NotReady blocker is recorded without an executable completion claim.
